          <p>
            One more option matters for emergencies: lights that also accept CR123A primary cells. The Streamlight ProTac HL-X USB runs on its rechargeable 18650 or on two CR123A cells. Primaries cannot be recharged, but they store for years without losing much charge, so they are the cheapest insurance against the scenario where the outage outlasts every battery you charged.
          </p>
